{"id":1010604,"name":"유구·심문 IV","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"유구·심문 IV","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1010604]}],"trial":{"trial_id":10604,"stage":"4단계","unlock_time":"2025-04-15 14:00:00","diary1":"유구는 심문실에 들어설 때부터 능력을 사용해 '자신의 이야기'를 들려주었다. 그녀는 세상의 파멸을 두 눈에 담겠다는 자신의 소원을 이루기 위해 국장을 또다시 이야기 속에 끌어들여 이미 정해진 '비극적인 결말'을 따라 움직이게 했다.","diary2":"운명이야말로 마지막 결말을 쓰는 존재다. 당신은 비극을 추종하는 자를 족쇄로 연결해 이야기가 마지막 장에 다다르기 전에 함께 운명 아래 가라앉았다.","evidence":[{"ID":260719,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260720,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110604001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110604002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":7,"dialogue_id":null,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110604004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110604005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110604006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110604007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110604008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110604009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110604010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110604011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110604012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110604013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110604014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110604015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110604016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110604017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110604018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110604019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110604020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110604021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":3,"dialogue_id":110604022,"next":[23]},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110604023,"next":null},{"step":24,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110604024,